abstract: >
  This repository contains a complete research project exploring modern detection
  techniques across Machine Learning (ML), Deep Learning (DL), and Anomaly-Based
  systems. It includes a full LaTeX research paper, diagrams, mathematical
  formulations, and hybrid detection code examples designed for enterprise-scale
  monitoring, fraud detection, cybersecurity, and LLMOps/MLOps reliability.
